{
  "caveats": [
    "Subscriptions are not unique people or households, and overlapping service categories must not be added together. The source flags mobile broadband subscriptions as rebased without specifying the rebasing date or method. Wireless local-loop counts include data-only and LTE services from 2021 onward. National totals do not show coverage, connection speed or geographic access. The 2022 data-inclusive density is printed as a dash and is retained without an exact numeric value.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
